# Paths the oracle build pipeline must never modify (one glob per line).
# Read by pipeline/oracle_build.py's CHECK stage; a spec's "## Never touch"
# section adds task-specific patterns on top of these repo defaults.
# Inline comments after " #" are stripped.

tests/golden/fixtures/* # golden consensus fixtures — regenerate only deliberately
docs/ORACLE_DISPOSITION_SPEC.md # build contract — a builder must never edit the spec to match the code
docs/oracle_runs/* # immutable run records
tests/disposition/fixtures/* # merge-blocking regression corpus — never edited to make tests pass
